      "message": "If the column does not exist, it would mean the table does not have the expected structure so everything is broken and nothing can ever work.\n\nThat being said as we discussed on MS07, I\u0027d rather not crash the system. Ideally we\u0027d neuter the entire memory store and maybe wipe the DB, but then it\u0027s easiest to do this in the maintenance phase, so for now I\u0027ll just make it so that it won\u0027t crash. Thanks for raising this.",
